------------------------------------------------------------------------
GTK3 port | Claude (AI assistant by Anthropic) | 2026-10-07

Ported from GTK2/gtkmm-2.4 to GTK3/gtkmm-3.0, entirely by Claude:
- configure/Makefile: require gtkmm-3.0, drop eggtrayicon
- tray icon rewritten on Gtk::StatusIcon (main loop ends via Gtk::Main::quit)
- menus rebuilt without Menu_Helpers; VBox/HBox -> Box; Table -> Grid
- Adjustment::create, get_content_area, removed GTK2-only calls
- fixes for modern g++ (History ctor, const char*, <cstring>)

